{"id":"ya","lemma":"ya","pos":"adv","rank":40,"glosses":["now, right now, (in the negative) anymore, no longer","by now, at this point","indicates completion of an action (difference from sense 4 depends on context)"],"ipa":"/ˈʝa/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/94/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-ya.wav","examples":[{"text":"Ya estoy en casa.","en":"I'm at home.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/438321"},{"text":"Deja ya de gritar.","en":"Stop shouting.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/510113"},{"text":"Ya nos podemos ir.","en":"We can go now.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443051"},{"text":"Ya lo he pillado.","en":"I do understand.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/424750"},{"text":"Ya la he cambiado.","en":"I've changed it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/508864"}]}